65
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:26,840
It doesn't matter the size of the loan I ask for or the type of business I propose.

66
00:05:27,200 --> 00:05:29,120
That's all inconsequential.

67
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:35,240
The first thing every bank will do is study how much money I have and how much debt

68
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:40,180
I have before they decide whether or not to lend me any more money.

69
00:05:40,660 --> 00:05:46,560
If I want to continue ahead with this dream of owning my own business, I have no

70
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:49,560
other choice but to build up my own finances.

71
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:55,140
I need around 20 more in personal savings and 50 less debt.

72
00:05:55,320 --> 00:05:57,200
That's all there is to it.

73
00:05:57,200 --> 00:05:58,980
I see now.

74
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:03,900
Well, it's a huge pity that they rejected your request, but don't lose hope.

75
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:09,120
I still think that your idea is great and that you would turn it into a phenomenal

