146
00:15:07,150 --> 00:15:12,470
But then when you see a picture, the idea finally clicks.

147
00:15:13,130 --> 00:15:18,370
If that sounds familiar, maybe you might consider yourself a visual learner.

148
00:15:18,750 --> 00:15:24,670
Or if reading or listening does the trick, maybe you feel like you're a verbal

149
00:15:24,670 --> 00:15:31,950
learner. call these labels learning styles, but is there really a way to categorize

150
00:15:31,950 --> 00:15:33,410
